%%{init: {'theme': 'default'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Sequence
    participant SQ as Sequencer
    participant D as Driver

    S->>SQ: finish_item(item)
    activate SQ
    Note over S: 阻塞等待

    SQ->>D: 事务入 FIFO
    D->>SQ: get_next_item(req)
    Note over D: ① 阻塞等待（FIFO为空则挂起）

    D->>D: drive_tx(req)
    Note over D: ② 事务→引脚时序

    D->>SQ: item_done(rsp)
    Note over D: ③ 通知完成

    SQ->>S: finish_item 返回
    deactivate SQ

    D->>SQ: get_next_item(req)
    Note over D: ④ 循环回①
